{"3779380":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Abyss Runner","steam_appid":3779380,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d0cf6388b45764056ddb3237063a49a7.poster.avif?t=1779350376\" width=756 height=420 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d0cf6388b45764056ddb3237063a49a7.webm?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d0cf6388b45764056ddb3237063a49a7.mp4?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">She possesses incredible magic abilities, but to be honest, she's a bit of an airhead...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One day, she's out taking a stroll when she comes across a massive, dark pit. Tons of monsters dwell in its depths, and suddenly, the perfect idea hits her! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Why not trick an adventurer into falling into it and give the monsters a tasty lunch?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Luckily, she has the perfect item to accomplish this--the Cursed Arm Binder! All she has to do is chuck it on an unassuming adventurer and fling him down the--<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Huh...?&quot;<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In an instant, Lily falls for her own trap... The arm binder is on her now!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> As it blocks out all magic power, Lily can no longer fly, and she finds herself plummeting down into the abyss, completely defenseless...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/e0138ef44b1a25613204ade7de4e4c19.poster.avif?t=1779350376\" width=756 height=124 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/e0138ef44b1a25613204ade7de4e4c19.webm?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/e0138ef44b1a25613204ade7de4e4c19.mp4?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/117e674134e4ae4d55a226ea612fa40b.poster.avif?t=1779350376\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/117e674134e4ae4d55a226ea612fa40b.webm?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/117e674134e4ae4d55a226ea612fa40b.mp4?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by similar ultra-difficult platformers, your only objective in this game is to keep climbing!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, there are tons of monsters around, and they'll do their best to get in your way...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you make it to the top?!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d36a9582421f0b7c971b614786472296.poster.avif?t=1779350376\" width=756 height=124 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d36a9582421f0b7c971b614786472296.webm?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/d36a9582421f0b7c971b614786472296.mp4?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/2e9029bcfa4dc01cebb1d108bd51f182.poster.avif?t=1779350376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/2e9029bcfa4dc01cebb1d108bd51f182.webm?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3779380\/extras\/2e9029bcfa4dc01cebb1d108bd51f182.mp4?t=1779350376\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong>Beware!<\/strong> This platformer is not for the faint of heart... Our beta testers were pulling their hair out!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In fact, it took the developer two entire days to reach the top! It wouldn't be much of a monster-filled abyss if it was easy, now would it?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All 4 areas will be trying their very best to get you to give up! Hang in there!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(p.s. There may be cheats for those who don't like super difficult stuff...)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/a